<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Spine-Tech raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Spine-Tech raised.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist raised its rating on Spine-Tech Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>- H&amp;Q said Spine-Tech's products are becoming the standard of care, and market penetration is both faster and deeper than expected.</p>
<p>- H&amp;Q rasied its second quarter earnings estimate to $0.16 a share from $0.12, its full-year 1997 estimate to $0.74 from $0.52, and its 1998 estimate to $1.55 from $0.85.</p>
</text>
